{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09067","headline":"郡斋赠王卿 · 韦应物","name":"郡斋赠王卿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"无术谬称简，素餐空自嗟。\n秋斋雨成滞，山药寒始华。\n濩落人皆笑，幽独岁逾赊。\n唯君出尘意，赏爱似山家。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09067.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09067","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}